  {
   "rating": 5,
   "date": "2026-09-26T16:00:11-05:00",
   "body": "I was able to pick this up as an Engineer. Not sure if it actually requires the profession.\n\nBefore buying or crafting the materials for this quest, make sure you finish all the other harvester objectives. They sometimes drop [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=4363/copper-modulator]Copper Modulators[/url], and I personally had 2 by the time I was finished in Westfall. Furthermore, the beach and Moonbrook are home to [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/object=19019/box-of-assorted-parts#map]boxes[/url] that occasionally contain them as well as [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=4405/crude-scope]Crude Scopes[/url].\n\nThe reward appears to basically be a flavor item/curiosity. A harvester under control has a [b]-40% Attack Speed[/b], [b]-20% Attack Power[/b] and a [b]-30% Casting Speed[/b] debuff and you can't use it if you already have another pet out. [s]With the level restriction, the toughest mobs you can actually use this on are [npc=2520] in The Deadmines, which is basically the only place where you can draw some limited utility from this.[/s] [b]The Deadmines golems are immune to this.[/b]",
   "replies": []
  }
 ]
